    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期鹅在杭州，在乌镇参加活动后坐上高铁直奔萧墨家里，聊了这期播客，拐洞也在</span></p><span></span><p><span>是萧墨选的主题，从有人花了3000 在生财上买了在我们看来都很过时的方法，赚了十几块钱，但是这个所谓“韭菜”很开心聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊到我们对赚钱的看法，自己创业的经历，虽然还是那几个破事儿，但是有了更多的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于我来说，录播客更像是朋友之间的分享和叙旧，顺便挂上了麦克风</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期聊天漫谈的播客，适合在大家需要陪伴的时候听</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：萧墨 王二鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：王二鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Misty》Ella Fitzgerald</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span>不想听第二遍本期就不写了</span></p><span></span><p><span>-你还可以在其他地方了解我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>@萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101"><span>《周五摸鱼》</span></a><span>萧墨 周阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>@王二鹅ERE</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：《饭后服用AfterHours》</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/视频号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df"><span>《二鹅EreTalk》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：王二鹅ERE</span></p>]]></description>
