  <item>
    <title>No.6《哪吒2》垃圾电影还是超越满分</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67acc7a05e6f58876df7f866</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67acc7a05e6f58876df7f866</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Feb 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是一集关于《哪吒2》不算太迟的讨论，萧墨v了我50让我去看我才去的，结果忘带3D眼镜，还好能租不然还得多花钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于这部电影我俩有截然相反的看法，萧墨觉得这部电影非常棒推荐给所有人完全超出预期。我则觉得这部电影完全不及格……</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎收听本期节目（友情提示：由于录制时间为元宵节，所以我讲话的有些部分会听到炮声，但是不太影响听感，还请各位听友多担待）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：萧墨 王二鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：王二鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4144">01:09:04</a> 《我要杀光浪漫杀死诗》当代电影大师</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:00:53</a> 萧墨认为是个满分电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">00:04:27</a> 二鹅给了《哪吒2》2.5星/豆瓣，以及其他春节档电影的评分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">00:06:15</a> 值得肯定的三个部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">00:08:15</a> 对于整部电影的评价八个大字“青春不老，我们不散”。整体是熊出没电影质感加上古偶的台词和人设，加上漫威大场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">00:10:33</a> 聊下敖广（敖丙他爹），萧墨觉得哇哦，我觉得爹味儿太重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="816">00:13:36</a> 敖丙人设完全变了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">00:17:12</a> 导演饺子的成长经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">00:22:55</a> 这期绝对不聊641</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">00:24:49</a> 饺子和张艺谋票房对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">00:29:11</a> 我为什么觉得《哪吒2》不及格的全方位吐槽，李靖夫妇堪比鹰眼和黑寡妇在复仇者联盟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">00:46:52</a> 申公豹他爸那段戏是整个电影的最高光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">00:55:50</a> 对中国电影以及文化影响力的小讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3648">01:00:48</a> 《哪吒3》该怎么拍</span></p><span></span><p><span>-你还可以在其他地方了解我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>@萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101"><span>《周五摸鱼》</span></a><span>萧墨 周阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>@王二鹅ERE</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：《饭后服用AfterHours》</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/视频号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df"><span>《二鹅EreTalk》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：王二鹅ERE</span></p>]]></description>
