  <item>
    <title>No.4 时隔两年萧墨和二鹅的再对话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678cf8bdfd386523661ef786</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678cf8bdfd386523661ef786</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 13:44:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一直吵吵和萧墨再录播客，其实是我不主动，很懒</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是马男，这期是我剪的，当然我现在全网都不叫这个名字了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我从录第一期时候的29岁也跨到了如今30多岁和萧墨一样老的年龄段。两个人可能都更成熟了，也可能还是一样sb</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个两年没认真聊天的老朋友，仔细聊了聊这两年都做了啥</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于开店，关于做项目，关于做自媒体，关于超级个体，关于中年男人的面子，关于名和利，关于文学，当然我俩的讨论离不开641这个话题，以及前几天在即刻上关于四百击的争论</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎收听本期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：萧墨 王二鹅 小黄⬇️（我家猫，背景里的喵音攻击）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：王二鹅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIj3YA8PIRiEWnqZZ6wWr0UaTXX.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Playlist：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7995">02:13:15</a> 《Heavy Wave》Motorama</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">00:02:25</a> 萧墨的另一档节目《周五摸鱼》已经6000订阅了，我也开了两个店以及公众号《饭后服用AfterHours》也突破了1万读者。聊下超级个体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">00:06:50</a> 萧墨2022年没上班都在干啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">00:09:01</a> 萧墨整电商如何失败的，以及感悟和上价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">00:12:33</a> 开书店的失败经历再分享，合伙人有感情纠葛上《1818黄金眼》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">00:16:36</a> 开始做游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">00:23:55</a> 开始做播客《周五摸鱼》，两个有天赋的人的产出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">00:28:31</a> 萧墨分享四大社群运营方法论：无根之水，无中生有，无本万利，起死回生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">00:33:09</a> 终于聊到群响了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">00:38:44</a> 二鹅2024没上班都在干啥，从超级个体聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">00:40:47</a> 脱离大厂叙事后的两个焦虑，社会身份和用户规模</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">00:44:15</a> 开店的基本原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">00:46:15</a> 我们这种互联网退休人员开店的三个关键点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">00:49:40</a> 线下坏人太多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">00:56:58</a> 关于创业和创业的基本原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3793">01:03:13</a> 萧墨在桌游圈内影响力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4091">01:08:11</a> 萧墨表扬我公众号写的好&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4241">01:10:41</a> 对自己内容输出的定位，以及自己的兴奋点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4622">01:17:02</a> 关于内容专业度，以及流量时代大家爱看什么的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4951">01:22:31</a> 641的情绪价值，t哥和张机的成长让萧墨欣慰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5222">01:27:02</a> AI产品黄叔，萧墨对AI 应用的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5502">01:31:42</a> 关于萧墨的写作天赋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5697">01:34:57</a> 从黄叔的即刻动态聊到四百击艺雯聊到刀姐和kk糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5972">01:39:32</a> 大厂叙事和自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6314">01:45:14</a> 萧墨要面儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6912">01:55:12</a> 二鹅对于内容创作的看法和目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7170">01:59:30</a> 文字的美感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7343">02:02:23</a> 二鹅只是希望让世界变得开心一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7381">02:03:01</a> 萧墨开始当爹给我建议了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7669">02:07:49</a> 我写作的心态和目标</span></p><span></span><p><span>-你还可以在其他地方了解我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>@萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64d24b61927830041174b101"><span>《周五摸鱼》</span></a><span>萧墨 周阿包&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：萧墨&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>@王二鹅ERE</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：《饭后服用AfterHours》</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/视频号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7?xsec_token=YBRR6LvegCHiZXiCPzyhEATjH5NK7POKvE6-sBcVNipHI=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a716ed5db2e602b441434b7&amp;apptime=1737291808&amp;share_id=4c2892aa85e049a3af02f1327e8a98df"><span>《二鹅EreTalk》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：王二鹅ERE</span></p>]]></description>
