  <item>
    <title>NO.1⅓ AI专栏丨从王慧文的AI创业开聊，谈谈我们对AI的幻想和担忧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f5ab6451a4e4150a058725</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63f5ab6451a4e4150a058725</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Feb 2023 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>梭哈是一种智慧，all in AI 已经成为历史必然。本播客经过三分钟的深思熟虑，决定加入AI产业链，开聊AI。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会从生活角度出发，重点聊聊AI对于普通人生活的影响。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>第一部分：是否看好王慧文的AI创业</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>萧墨：完全不看好，招不到人</span></p><span></span><h2><span>马男：看好，能招到人</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 王慧文的AI英雄榜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fra-mJbgMiFLDXliDmsBo30Q5Hb7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">8:45</a> 第一次提到陆奇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 第二次提到陆奇&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>第二部分：目前AI对我们生活的影响</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> ChatGPT和AI绘画对于我们生活的影响</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9QtLXDQ9DE5u3eRxaMnI-xZ4X1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> 通过图灵测试的AI与电信诈骗</span></p><span></span><p><span>拓展阅读：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uM411t7ZJ/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uM411t7ZJ/"><span>《</span></a><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uM411t7ZJ/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uM411t7ZJ/"><span>赛博女友，完美变声，如今AI语音有多超乎想象?》@-LKs-</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iY411971a" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iY411971a"><span>《男子与电信诈骗的对话，平静的让人绝望》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">40:35</a> 关于AI医疗的展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">45:33</a> 关于AI产生数字生命的道德悖论</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>第三部分：结束收工</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3220">53:40</a> 片尾曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3416">56:56</a> 彩蛋1：AI声音辨别题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3497">58:17</a> 其他彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：萧墨、马男</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《Wake UP！！》时光乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：萧墨</span></p><span></span><p><span>（剪辑太累了，希望马男v我50）</span></p>]]></description>
